{"id":"n48467-1-11","stage":4,"title":"대대로 · 世代","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48467-1-11-1","ko":"아버지, 우리도 도시에 가서 살아요.","zh":"爸爸，我们也去城里住吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지,","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"도시에","meaning":"都市，城市","explanation":"도시：都市，城市；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"도시","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70743","senseId":"1","lemma":"도시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도시에","audio":"/audio/7e2fce483a4e7e8db679.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"살아요.","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아요","audio":"/audio/c21baf3f3fa55089ec53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"abbc940f03792a89","term":"도시","zh":"都市，城市","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3","entryId":"70743","definition":"成为政治、经济和文化的中心，且人口大量居住的地区。","pronunciation":["도시"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/509c3f5e695f29c17d3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48467-1-11-2","ko":"대대로 물려받은 이 땅과 고향을 버릴 수는 없다.","zh":"这片世代相传的土地和故乡，我们是不能放弃的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대대로","meaning":"世代，祖传","explanation":"대대로：世代，祖传。","readings":[{"term":"대대로","audio":"/audio/44ccd1066ad6081f8656.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48467","senseId":"1","lemma":"대대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대대로","audio":"/audio/44ccd1066ad6081f8656.mp3"}},{"text":"물려받은","meaning":"继承，接手","explanation":"물려받다：继承，接手；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"물려받다","audio":"/audio/69105aebecc7e1b73978.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56210","senseId":"1","lemma":"물려받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물려받은","audio":"/audio/084e8372a97e8fd5c652.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"땅과","meaning":"地区，土地","explanation":"땅：地区，土地；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"3","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅과","audio":"/audio/654653d21c8f4a173da0.mp3"}},{"text":"고향을","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향을","audio":"/audio/f88a4f5edc178f2586ad.mp3"}},{"text":"버릴","meaning":"抛弃，遗弃","explanation":"버리다：抛弃，遗弃；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"3","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버릴","audio":"/audio/c4301be65bb74275483b.mp3"}},{"text":"수는","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수는","audio":"/audio/0ae6625dd24dc5dcc565.mp3"}},{"text":"없다.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"44ccd1066ad6081f","term":"대대로","zh":"世代，祖传","audio":"/audio/44ccd1066ad6081f8656.mp3","entryId":"48467","definition":"从古至今已过好几代，一直在持续。","pronunciation":["대ː대로"]},{"id":"69105aebecc7e1b7","term":"물려받다","zh":"继承，接手","audio":"/audio/69105aebecc7e1b73978.mp3","entryId":"56210","definition":"从父母或祖辈处接受传下来的财产、职业、地位等。","pronunciation":["물려받따"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地区，土地","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"地域或地方。","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"抛弃，遗弃","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"65570","definition":"离开家庭、故乡、国家等，并断绝关系。","pronunciation":["버리다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d6cb918fd4a0a72285e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48467","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8543,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这片世代相传的土地和故乡，我们是不能放弃的。","爸爸，我们也去城里住吧。","我有个超级棒的创业计划哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，我们也去城里住吧。","我有个超级棒的创业计划哦。","这片世代相传的土地和故乡，我们是不能放弃的。"],"answer":2}]}
